      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还会继续陪在你身边的哦。\r\n今后也会……一直陪在你身边。\r\n英雄身边的……果然得是『新宇』才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2dd7380c9184ae93e95a6f59c57f877832bd9d27fe76890d5ab6acbdb9938d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
