      "uid": "zhcn:125492e7e35e9abf4af696ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "二人相视而笑。\r\n她们共同追寻的荣光，\r\n化作夜空的繁星——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7802f556b5f40cf8966152ed78878f761538fb2d261434d22c0a04e1c8ec1273",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
